* Debye-Huckel test topology: point ions and a 5-bead charged chain
*
36 1

MASS  -1  IP   10.0     ! cation, no LJ
MASS  -1  IN   10.0     ! anion,  no LJ
MASS  -1  QP   10.0     ! chain bead, +1
MASS  -1  QN   10.0     ! chain bead, -1

AUTOGENERATE ANGLES DIHEDRALS

RESI POS   1.00
GROUP
ATOM Q1  IP   1.00
PATCH FIRST NONE LAST NONE

RESI NEG  -1.00
GROUP
ATOM Q1  IN  -1.00
PATCH FIRST NONE LAST NONE

RESI CHN   1.00         ! +1 -1 +1 -1 +1
GROUP
ATOM A1  QP   1.00
ATOM A2  QN  -1.00
ATOM A3  QP   1.00
ATOM A4  QN  -1.00
ATOM A5  QP   1.00
BOND A1 A2  A2 A3  A3 A4  A4 A5
PATCH FIRST NONE LAST NONE

END
